			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140040201,
					"content": "曾经以为「梅洛彼得堡」会很可怕，现在想想气氛其实也还不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040202,
					"content": "生活稳定，每天都有饭吃，能用「特许券」买各式各样的东西，难怪很多犯人不愿意离开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040203,
						140040204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040203,
					"content": "的确如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040205,
					"content": "哦，你在说莱欧斯利啊，我也觉得他是个很有本事的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040206,
					"content": "虽然看上去有点严肃，但实际接触了之后，感觉也挺好说话的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040207,
					"content": "不知道他对这里的人是什么样的态度，难道说，看人下菜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040208,
					"content": "没点手段可不行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040209,
					"content": "嗯，能让这里的人都守规矩，又不显得压抑，他一定有独到的管理经验吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040210,
					"content": "请问，有人在吗？求求你们帮我一个忙好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040211,
					"content": "欸？我刚刚是不是听到了什么声音？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040212,
					"content": "我好像也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040213,
					"content": "请问，有人路过吗？可不可以帮我一个忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040214,
					"content": "确实，没有听错，在这边！但没看到人啊，怎么会…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040215,
					"content": "啊，是有人听到吗？你好，在这边，箱子里面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040216,
					"content": "#箱子？怪不得没看到人。唉，{NICKNAME}，我们过去看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040217,
					"content": "你干嘛要躲在箱子里啊，要是没人路过，不管你喊多久都是白费力气哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040218,
					"content": "呃，原因比较复杂，可以先不追究吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040219,
						140040220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040219,
					"content": "难道是眉毛被人剃掉了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040221,
					"content": "呜哇，好过分，你是被霸凌了吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040222,
					"content": "不是不是，没有那么严重，我只是想让人帮我找一下我的帽子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040223,
					"content": "只是帽子而已？那为什么要躲起来？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040224,
					"content": "哦，我懂了！你的头发是不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040225,
						140040226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040225,
					"content": "派蒙，别问了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040227,
					"content": "对不起，对不起。我明白了，原来是这样啊，嘿嘿，难怪你不愿意见人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040228,
					"content": "帽子对吧，我们马上就去帮你找回来。它长什么样呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040229,
					"content": "感觉你们误会了什么，但是…唉，算了，只要能把帽子找回来就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040230,
					"content": "那是一顶带檐的软帽子，棕色，样式比较普通。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040231,
					"content": "大概就掉在入口的升降平台附近。因为有点热，我取下帽子休息了一会儿，回过神来它就不见了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040232,
					"content": "拜托你们了，帽子对我很重要，我就在这里等你们回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "费索勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040233,
					"content": "放心吧，去去就回。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140040226,
					"content": "派蒙，留点面子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040220,
					"content": "难道是衣服被人撕坏了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140040204,
					"content": "大概这就是那个人的管理风格。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140040205
					]
				}
			]
		},
